{"data":{"__type":{"kind":"ENUM","name":"ImmediateAuthActionType","description":null,"fields":null,"inputFields":null,"interfaces":null,"enumValues":[{"name":"CONTINUE_TO_PRO_SIGNUP","description":"Zero-UI skip of the second Pro conversion interstitial. Returned by RAR on\nimdb_pro_amazon_convert_linking for business Amazon accounts, which convert immediately\nwithout showing the second interstitial. Client performs the cookie swap and navigates to\n/signup/pro/start?pap_cnvrt=<value> zero-UI — the same action as the CONTINUE_TO_PRO_SIGNUP\nbutton on the second interstitial. pap_cnvrt is a base64-encoded string in the same format\nas the siteState value on an AuthPortal sign-in URL.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CONVERT_LWA_TO_AAP","description":"Mutation trigger — LWA → AAP conversion path. Returned by RAR pre-flight on\nimdb_amazon_linking when the Amazon account IS the existing LWA-linked account for\nthis PAP user. Sign-in handler auto-executes convertLoginWithAmazonToAmazonAccountPool(amazonToken).\nUser consent was already obtained on the prior interstitial screen; no additional UI shown.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"CONVERT_TO_AAP","description":"Mutation trigger — standard PAP → AAP conversion path. Returned by RAR pre-flight on\nimdb_amazon_linking when the Amazon account is NOT the existing LWA-linked account for\nthis user. Sign-in handler auto-executes convertToAmazonAccountPool(papToken, amazonToken).\nUser consent was already obtained on the prior interstitial screen; no additional UI shown.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_AMAZON_LINKING","description":"Handle selector — returned on imdb_us_linking / imdb_apple_linking / imdb_google_linking\n(and mobile equivalents) after the user completes the verify step. Client redirects zero-UI\nto the platform-appropriate Amazon linking handle:\n    Web:     imdb_amazon_linking\n    iOS:     imdb_mobile_ios_amazon_linking\n    Android: imdb_mobile_android_amazon_linking\nRAR pre-flight on that handle returns CONVERT_TO_AAP, CONVERT_LWA_TO_AAP, or\nSHOW_AMAZON_ACCOUNT_IN_USE_INTERSTITIAL.\nNot returned on PAP/3P entry handles (imdb_us, imdb_apple, imdb_google) —\nthose return interstitial: SHOW_PAP_TO_AAP_CONVERSION instead.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null},{"name":"SIGN_IN_WITH_PRO_AMAZON_CONVERT","description":"Handle selector — Pro PAP → AAP conversion. Returned by RAR on imdb_pro_us_linking after\nthe user re-authenticates with their IMDb Pro credentials (\"Sign in with IMDb\" path).\nClient redirects zero-UI to the imdb_pro_amazon_convert_linking association handle, where\nboth the \"Sign in with IMDb\" and \"Sign in with Amazon\" Pro conversion paths converge.","isDeprecated":false,"deprecationReason":null}],"possibleTypes":null}},"extensions":{"disclaimer":"Public, commercial, and/or non-private use of the IMDb data provided by this API is not allowed. For limited non-commercial use of IMDb data and the associated requirements see https://help.imdb.com/article/imdb/general-information/can-i-use-imdb-data-in-my-software/G5JTRESSHJBBHTGX#"}}
